    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29455" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlīnus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		mola, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a mill, mill-</i>
			(eccl. Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saxum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 4, 35</span></i>
			.—Hence, as <i>subst.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlīna</span></b> ,
